        "@value": "prohibition"
      }
    ],
    "https://example.org/ibc/ontology/text": [
      {
        "@value": "2. In Group F, H and S occupancies, other than areas of parking structures accessible to the public, openings in treads and landings shall not be prohibited provided that a sphere with a diameter of 11/8 inches (29 mm) cannot pass through the opening."
      }
    ]
  },
