      {
        "@value": "5.2. Either the exit from the dwelling unit discharges directly to the exterior at the level of exit discharge, or the exit access outside the dwelling unit’s entrance door provides access to not less than two approved independent exits."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://example.org/ibc/2021/sem-ibc2021-1011.15.2-atomic-1",
