      {
        "@value": "5. Where a platform lift is in a stationary position and the floor of the platform lift serves as the upper landing of a stairway, handrails shall not be required on the stairway, provided that all of the following criteria are met:"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://example.org/ibc/2021/sem-ibc2021-1015.8.1-atomic-1",
