        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer",
        "@value": 311
      }
    ],
    "https://example.org/ibc/ontology/text": [
      {
        "@value": "1. Where interior exit stairways or ramps are interconnected by a 1-hour fire-resistance-rated corridor conforming to the requirements of Section 1020, the required exit separation shall be measured along the shortest direct line of travel within the corridor."
      }
    ]
  },
