    "https://example.org/ibc/ontology/text": [
      {
        "@value": "1031.5.1 Minimum size. The minimum horizontal area of the area well shall be 9 square feet (0.84 m2), with a horizontal projection and width of not less than 36 inches (914 mm). The area well shall allow the emergency escape and rescue opening to be fully opened."
