        "@id": "https://example.org/ibc/2021/ibc2021-ch10-list_item-0108"
      }
    ],
    "https://example.org/ibc/ontology/sourcePage": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer",
        "@value": 309
      }
    ],
    "https://example.org/ibc/ontology/text": [
      {
        "@value": "e. The common path of egress travel distance shall only apply in a Group R-3 occupancy located in a mixed occupancy building."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://example.org/ibc/2021/sem-ibc2021-1010.5.1.1-condition-1",
    "@type": [
      "https://example.org/ibc/ontology/Condition"
    ],
    "https://example.org/ibc/ontology/text": [
      {
        "@value": "Where located as part of an accessible route, turnstiles shall have not less than 36 inches (914 mm) clear width at and below a height of 34 inches (864 mm), not less than 32 inches (813 mm) clear width between 34 inches (864 mm) and 80 inches (2032 mm) and shall consist of a mechanism other than a revolving device."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
