      }
    ],
    "https://example.org/ibc/ontology/text": [
      {
        "@value": "1011.15 Ship’s ladders. Ship’s ladders are permitted to be used in Group I-3 as a component of a means of egress to and from control rooms or elevated facility observation stations not more than 250 square feet (23 m2) with not more than three occupants and for access to unoccupied roofs. The minimum clear width at and below the handrails shall be 20 inches (508 mm). Ship’s ladders shall be designed for the live loads indicated in Section 1607.17."
      }
    ]
  },
