      {
        "@value": "g. For the travel distance limitations in Groups R-3 and R-4 equipped throughout with an automatic sprinkler system in accordance with Section 903.3.1.3, see Section 1006.2.2.6. Section 903.3.1.3, the exit access travel distance for Group R-4 shall be not more than 75 feet (22 860 mm)."
