        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer",
        "@value": 324
      }
    ],
    "https://example.org/ibc/ontology/text": [
      {
        "@value": "1010.5.1.1 Clear width. Where located as part of an accessible route, turnstiles shall have not less than 36 inches (914 mm) clear width at and below a height of 34 inches (864 mm), not less than 32 inches (813 mm) clear width between 34 inches (864 mm) and 80 inches (2032 mm) and shall consist of a mechanism other than a revolving device."
      }
    ]
  },
