        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer",
        "@value": 327
      }
    ],
    "https://example.org/ibc/ontology/text": [
      {
        "@value": "1011.10 Spiral stairways. Spiral stairways are permitted to be used as a component in the means of egress only within dwelling units or from a space not more than 250 square feet (23 m2) in area and serving not more than five occupants, or from technical production areas in accordance with Section"
      }
    ]
  },
