        "@value": "[346.193, 692.732, 565.272, 736.782]"
      }
    ],
    "https://example.org/ibc/ontology/heading": [
      {
        "@value": "Refrigeration machinery rooms"
      }
    ],
    "https://example.org/ibc/ontology/label": [
      {
        "@value": "1006.2.2.2"
      }
    ],
    "https://example.org/ibc/ontology/partOf": [
      {
        "@id": "https://example.org/ibc/2021/ibc2021-1006.2.2"
      }
    ],
    "https://example.org/ibc/ontology/precedes": [
      {
        "@id": "https://example.org/ibc/2021/ibc2021-1006.2.2.3"
      }
    ],
    "https://example.org/ibc/ontology/sourcePage": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer",
        "@value": 309
      },
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer",
        "@value": 308
      }
    ],
    "https://example.org/ibc/ontology/text": [
      {
        "@value": "1006.2.2.2 Refrigeration machinery rooms. Machinery rooms larger than 1,000 square feet (93 m2) shall have not less than two exits or exit access doorways. Where two exit access doorways are required, one such doorway is permitted to be served by a fixed ladder or an alternating tread device. Exit access doorways shall be separated by a horizontal distance equal to one-half the maximum horizontal dimension of the room. All portions of machinery rooms shall be within 150 feet (45 720 mm) of an exit or exit access doorway. An increase in exit access travel distance is permitted in accordance with Section 1017.1. Exit and exit access doorways shall swing in the direction of egress travel and shall be equipped with panic hardware, regardless of the occupant load served. Exit and exit access doorways shall be tight fitting and self-closing."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://example.org/ibc/2021/sem-ibc2021-ch10-list_item-0368-atomic-1",
    "@type": [
      "https://example.org/ibc/ontology/AtomicRule"
    ],
    "https://example.org/ibc/ontology/modality": [
      {
        "@value": "shall_not"
      }
    ],
    "https://example.org/ibc/ontology/statementType": [
      {
        "@value": "prohibition"
      }
    ],
    "https://example.org/ibc/ontology/text": [
      {
        "@value": "This section shall not apply to doors arranged in accordance with Section 403.5.3."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://example.org/ibc/2021/sem-ibc2021-ch10-list_item-0260-atomic-3",
    "@type": [
      "https://example.org/ibc/ontology/AtomicRule"
    ],
    "https://example.org/ibc/ontology/modality": [
      {
        "@value": "shall"
      }
    ],
    "https://example.org/ibc/ontology/statementType": [
      {
        "@value": "obligation"
      }
    ],
    "https://example.org/ibc/ontology/text": [
      {
        "@value": "Additionally, visual characters, raised character and braille signage complying with ICC A117.1 shall be located at each door to an area of refuge and exterior area for assisted rescue in accordance with Section 1013.4."
      }
    ]
  },
