        "@value": "obligation"
      }
    ],
    "https://example.org/ibc/ontology/text": [
      {
        "@value": "2. For other swinging doors, sliding doors or folding doors, and doors required to be fire rated, the door shall require not more than a 30-pound (133 N) force to be set in motion and shall move to a fullopen position when subjected to not more than a 15-pound (67 N) force."
      }
