      {
        "@value": "In occupancy Group R-2 or R-3, threshold heights for sliding and side-hinged exterior doors shall be permitted to be up to 73/4 inches (197 mm) in height if all of the following apply:"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://example.org/ibc/2021/sem-ibc2021-1009.6.4-atomic-1",
