      {
        "@value": "4. In Group I-2, Condition 2 occupancies, the length of dead-end corridors that do not serve patient rooms or patient treatment spaces shall not exceed 30 feet (9144 mm)."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://example.org/ibc/2021/sem-ibc2021-1010.2.4-atomic-1",
