        "@value": "obligation"
      }
    ],
    "https://example.org/ibc/ontology/text": [
      {
        "@value": "1026.3 Opening protectives. Fire doors in horizontal exits shall be self-closing or automatic-closing when activated by a smoke detector in accordance with Section 716.2.6.6. Doors, where located in a cross-corridor condition, shall be automatic-closing by activation of a smoke detector installed in accordance with Section 716.2.6.6."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
