        "@value": 321
      }
    ],
    "https://example.org/ibc/ontology/text": [
      {
        "@value": "4. An attempt to egress shall initiate an irreversible process that shall allow such egress in not more than 15 seconds when a physical effort to exit is applied to the egress side door hardware for not more than 3 seconds. Initiation of the irreversible process shall activate an audible signal in the vicinity of the door. Once the delay electronics have been deactivated, rearming the delay electronics shall be by manual means only."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://example.org/ibc/2021/ibc2021-ch10-list_item-0318",
    "@type": [
