        "@value": 333
      }
    ],
    "https://example.org/ibc/ontology/text": [
      {
        "@value": "1015.8 Window openings. Windows in Group R-2 and R-3 buildings including dwelling units, where the bottom of the clear opening of an operable window is located less than 36 inches (914 mm) above the finished floor and more than 72 inches (1829 mm) above the finished grade or other surface below on the exterior of the building, shall comply with one of the following:"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
